WEBVTT

01:21.360 --> 01:26.780
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.510 --> 01:29.590
[Episode 22]

01:33.200 --> 01:34.150
Are you here

01:34.150 --> 01:35.509
because of the rumors?

01:36.640 --> 01:37.789
About us,

01:39.150 --> 01:40.200
I'm afraid everyone in your mansion

01:40.200 --> 01:41.060
already knows.

01:42.430 --> 01:43.789
Most likely.

01:46.840 --> 01:48.350
But who started the rumor

01:49.229 --> 01:50.229
is easy to guess.

01:50.560 --> 01:52.690
Suspicion is limited to three people.

01:52.759 --> 01:54.620
It must be inconvenient for a girl

01:54.789 --> 01:56.310
to handle this kind of thing.

01:56.310 --> 01:56.950
How about

01:57.710 --> 01:58.789
I step in?

02:00.640 --> 02:01.950
How will you handle it?

02:03.200 --> 02:04.800
By coming to ask for your hand

02:05.590 --> 02:06.920
in marriage, of course.

02:18.430 --> 02:19.079
No, no, no.

02:20.750 --> 02:21.870
That's too fast.

02:22.079 --> 02:24.000
Aren't we still discussing it?

02:25.710 --> 02:27.240
You'd better not handle it.

02:27.280 --> 02:28.630
I can handle it myself.

02:29.630 --> 02:31.000
Since everyone knows,

02:31.000 --> 02:31.910
we might as well

02:32.470 --> 02:33.730
just make it official.

02:34.150 --> 02:34.680
No.

02:36.220 --> 02:37.890
I haven't figured it out yet.

02:39.329 --> 02:40.520
I'm begging you.

02:48.400 --> 02:48.960
Alright.

02:49.430 --> 02:51.120
I'll listen to you then.

03:00.280 --> 03:02.060
You should go to the palace now.

03:02.120 --> 03:03.960
So many affairs of the Imperial Court
are waiting for you.

03:03.960 --> 03:04.690
I'm leaving.

03:05.280 --> 03:06.610
I'll wait for your word.

03:24.910 --> 03:26.640
What are you two nannies doing?

03:28.240 --> 03:29.780
What are you doing?

03:29.810 --> 03:31.150
You little girl,

03:31.300 --> 03:32.350
you talk too much.

03:32.430 --> 03:33.190
We're sending you...

03:33.190 --> 03:34.630
-To a place where you can learn to behave.
-Wait.

03:34.630 --> 03:35.120
Go!

03:35.840 --> 03:36.800
What's going on here?

03:36.800 --> 03:38.350
Miss Qingpu, save me!

03:38.380 --> 03:39.380
Behave yourself!

03:39.490 --> 03:40.620
What a coincidence.

03:41.240 --> 03:42.520
I was just thinking of
tying her up myself.

03:42.520 --> 03:43.150
Why don't you

03:43.150 --> 03:44.480
just hand her over to me?

03:46.630 --> 03:47.280
Mother!

03:49.190 --> 03:49.910
Mother!

03:52.240 --> 03:53.570
I've heard everything.

03:53.680 --> 03:55.680
I'm sorry you've been troubled, Mother.

03:55.680 --> 03:56.530
Lian!

03:56.550 --> 03:57.800
Mother.

03:57.870 --> 03:59.520
Why did you do this?

04:00.470 --> 04:02.400
Mother, I'm just so angry.

04:02.430 --> 04:03.300
Why should I

04:03.330 --> 04:05.360
have to cover up her dirty secret

04:05.710 --> 04:06.360
after

04:06.360 --> 04:08.400
she cheated me out of my dowry silver?

04:08.400 --> 04:09.400
Why should I?

04:09.400 --> 04:10.560
Her dirty secret?

04:11.590 --> 04:13.080
It involves Chen Yanyun.

04:13.750 --> 04:15.310
But didn't you tell me

04:16.310 --> 04:17.160
that Chen Yanyun

04:17.160 --> 04:19.000
just treats her as a mistress?

04:19.019 --> 04:20.079
Even as a mistress,

04:20.600 --> 04:21.360
she is still

04:21.360 --> 04:22.740
Chen Yanyun's woman.

04:23.240 --> 04:24.270
If he finds out

04:24.290 --> 04:26.270
you've been spreading rumors

04:26.600 --> 04:28.240
about her with another man,

04:28.630 --> 04:30.120
he won't let it go easily.

04:33.510 --> 04:34.690
So what?

04:35.270 --> 04:36.970
No matter how powerful Chen Yanyun is,

04:36.970 --> 04:37.950
can he really meddle

04:37.950 --> 04:39.420
in our family affairs?

04:40.510 --> 04:42.659
I just want to get back at Gu Jinzhao.

04:43.510 --> 04:45.240
So what if she has Chen Yanyun?

04:45.920 --> 04:47.450
I have Brother Wenxiu

04:47.470 --> 04:48.570
and the Yao family.

04:49.070 --> 04:49.950
I'm not afraid of her.

04:49.950 --> 04:51.560
Compared to Chen Yanyun,

04:51.720 --> 04:53.180
the Yao family is nothing.

04:54.170 --> 04:56.070
If you keep acting up like this outside,

04:56.070 --> 04:57.560
you'll eventually get your father killed

04:57.560 --> 04:59.140
and doom our Gu family.

04:59.600 --> 05:01.060
Please calm down, Mother.

05:03.310 --> 05:04.070
Mother,

05:04.750 --> 05:05.770
what Lian did

05:05.920 --> 05:07.390
was indeed reckless.

05:07.920 --> 05:10.070
But it can't be that serious, right?

05:10.830 --> 05:11.880
At worst,

05:12.070 --> 05:13.800
we apologize privately

05:13.800 --> 05:14.930
and leave it at that.

05:15.430 --> 05:16.960
If things really go public,

05:17.160 --> 05:17.950
Chen Yanyun himself

05:17.950 --> 05:19.990
would lose face too.

05:20.040 --> 05:21.440
You don't know anything!

05:23.950 --> 05:25.210
My second son's career

05:25.560 --> 05:27.820
will be ruined by you two sooner or later.

05:44.150 --> 05:45.620
Old Madam,

05:45.870 --> 05:46.480
bad news!

05:46.920 --> 05:48.000
Tang hasn't been sent away.

05:48.000 --> 05:49.590
Miss Gu brought her here.

05:51.510 --> 05:52.600
Miss Gu is here.

05:56.630 --> 05:58.159
Grandmother, Second Aunt.

05:59.630 --> 06:00.800
Lian is here too.

06:01.040 --> 06:02.190
It seems everyone is here,

06:02.190 --> 06:04.850
saving me the trouble of inviting you
one by one.

06:07.390 --> 06:09.250
You don't need to be so sarcastic.

06:09.950 --> 06:11.480
I know you've been wronged.

06:11.950 --> 06:12.800
I also heard about

06:12.800 --> 06:13.750
the rumors.

06:14.920 --> 06:17.120
Your Second Aunt investigated all day.

06:17.680 --> 06:18.510
Now we know

06:19.560 --> 06:21.490
that this Tang started the rumors.

06:22.390 --> 06:23.950
I was just about to order someone

06:23.950 --> 06:24.800
to seize her.

06:25.920 --> 06:27.390
Great minds think alike.

06:28.750 --> 06:30.680
Grandmother, you are so wise.

06:31.240 --> 06:32.430
But I feel that

06:32.680 --> 06:33.750
Tang wouldn't start rumors

06:33.750 --> 06:34.600
for no reason.

06:35.159 --> 06:37.090
Someone must have instructed her.

06:38.870 --> 06:40.240
Isn't that right, Tang?

06:41.510 --> 06:42.310
Tang,

06:43.240 --> 06:44.750
just watch your tongue.

06:50.720 --> 06:51.600
Tang,

06:52.600 --> 06:54.460
if Qingpu hadn't arrived in time,

06:54.870 --> 06:55.870
I'm afraid by now

06:56.190 --> 06:59.050
you'd already have been sent
to the village estate.

07:05.070 --> 07:06.500
My lady told me to do it.

07:06.880 --> 07:08.360
She told me to go to Baoxiang Temple.

07:08.360 --> 07:10.390
Your lady asked you
to go to Baoxiang Temple

07:10.390 --> 07:11.800
to pray for a blessed bracelet

07:11.800 --> 07:13.210
for her,

07:13.430 --> 07:15.060
not to talk nonsense here

07:15.360 --> 07:17.360
and ruin your master's reputation.

07:17.950 --> 07:18.870
Exactly.

07:19.070 --> 07:21.000
I never asked you to spread rumors.

07:21.270 --> 07:21.830
My Lady.

07:22.000 --> 07:23.610
You did tell me to do that!

07:24.160 --> 07:25.680
If you hadn't taught me those words,

07:25.680 --> 07:27.000
how could I have said them?

07:27.000 --> 07:27.430
You...

07:29.470 --> 07:31.100
Don't talk nonsense!

07:31.390 --> 07:32.040
Mother.

07:32.630 --> 07:33.120
Ms. Su.

07:33.120 --> 07:33.430
Yes!

07:33.510 --> 07:34.370
Slap her mouth!

07:34.480 --> 07:34.950
Yes!

07:41.510 --> 07:42.300
Miss Gu!

07:42.630 --> 07:43.430
It really was my lady who told me

07:43.430 --> 07:44.070
to talk about you

07:44.070 --> 07:45.390
and Mr. Wang.

07:45.870 --> 07:46.560
She even

07:46.750 --> 07:48.430
specifically asked me
to go to Baoxiang Temple,

07:48.430 --> 07:50.070
saying there are many officials' families
burning incense there,

07:50.070 --> 07:51.680
and told me to spread it
among the servants.

07:51.680 --> 07:52.120
This was all...

07:52.120 --> 07:53.580
My Lady made me do all of it!

07:53.750 --> 07:55.159
I didn't! I didn't!

07:55.360 --> 07:56.720
I didn't!

07:56.950 --> 07:57.680
Grandmother.

07:57.680 --> 07:59.270
Alright, alright, alright!

07:59.270 --> 07:59.950
Tang

08:00.430 --> 08:01.190
was originally my personal maid

08:01.190 --> 08:02.920
I assigned to Lian.

08:03.420 --> 08:05.310
Since you took it upon yourself
to spread rumors

08:05.310 --> 08:06.710
and slander your master,

08:07.600 --> 08:09.240
you will receive twenty lashes

08:09.240 --> 08:10.870
and be sent to the village estate,

08:10.870 --> 08:12.600
never to return to the capital!

08:13.510 --> 08:14.310
Grandmother,

08:15.510 --> 08:16.870
no punishment is too severe

08:16.870 --> 08:18.240
for Tang's evil deeds.

08:18.600 --> 08:19.530
But don't forget

08:20.120 --> 08:21.850
that the instigator is Lian.

08:21.950 --> 08:23.280
Please don't be biased.

08:24.360 --> 08:25.390
What's the rush?

08:26.120 --> 08:28.650
Who said I was going to be biased
towards Lian?

08:29.630 --> 08:30.510
Lian

08:30.750 --> 08:32.000
failed to manage the servant properly,

08:32.000 --> 08:33.730
causing herself to be wronged.

08:33.750 --> 08:35.120
She must also be punished.

08:35.120 --> 08:37.520
You will receive twenty strikes
on the hand

08:37.960 --> 08:39.150
and kneel in the ancestral hall

08:39.150 --> 08:40.030
for three days.

08:40.150 --> 08:41.360
Grandmother.

08:42.630 --> 08:43.390
What?

08:44.200 --> 08:45.600
Such a light punishment!

08:45.750 --> 08:47.080
Gu Jinzhao, I'm telling you,

08:47.080 --> 08:48.280
don't push it too far!

08:48.550 --> 08:50.000
Lian knows she was wrong.

08:50.510 --> 08:51.380
Thank you, Mother.

08:51.380 --> 08:52.270
We will go take the punishment.

08:52.270 --> 08:53.000
Let's go.

08:53.000 --> 08:54.370
We're going to take the punishment.

08:54.370 --> 08:55.670
We know we were wrong.

08:55.840 --> 08:56.510
Ms. Su,

08:57.040 --> 08:58.600
drag this little wench out now.

08:58.600 --> 08:59.730
Yes. Someone!

08:59.870 --> 09:00.840
Drag her out!

09:01.030 --> 09:01.750
Old Madam!

09:02.030 --> 09:03.550
Old Madam, I've been wronged!

09:03.550 --> 09:03.910
Go!

09:03.910 --> 09:05.670
My lady made me do it all!

09:05.790 --> 09:07.330
-I've been wronged!
-Go!

09:07.630 --> 09:08.720
Old Madam!

09:08.720 --> 09:09.720
Everyone, leave.

09:10.870 --> 09:11.730
Zhao, you stay.

09:11.960 --> 09:12.510
Yes.

09:12.960 --> 09:14.510
Qingpu, you may leave too.

09:15.390 --> 09:15.910
Yes.

09:19.790 --> 09:20.720
Grandmother,

09:21.600 --> 09:23.000
what are you trying to do?

09:28.150 --> 09:29.000
Zhao,

09:30.200 --> 09:31.660
don't look at me like that.

09:33.670 --> 09:34.600
This matter...

09:34.840 --> 09:36.000
Of course I know

09:37.030 --> 09:38.290
this was Lian's fault.

09:43.510 --> 09:44.910
But in the second branch,

09:45.510 --> 09:46.350
Lian is

09:46.440 --> 09:48.240
the only legitimate daughter.

09:48.600 --> 09:50.600
I can't just throw her out too, can I?

09:52.510 --> 09:54.040
Forgive me for being blunt,

09:55.030 --> 09:57.360
but your reputation is already what it is.

09:57.390 --> 09:58.760
If Lian's reputation

09:58.840 --> 09:59.840
gets damaged too,

10:00.460 --> 10:01.920
what about our Gu Mansion?

10:02.440 --> 10:04.120
Hui, Lan,

10:04.510 --> 10:06.080
Rong, and Xian...

10:06.270 --> 10:07.200
What about them?

10:07.510 --> 10:09.200
How will they marry in the future?

10:09.200 --> 10:10.800
How will they face the world?

10:12.150 --> 10:14.000
So the top priority now

10:16.480 --> 10:18.150
is not how to punish,

10:18.440 --> 10:19.960
but how to remedy.

10:21.870 --> 10:24.150
It seems Grandmother already has a plan.

10:25.480 --> 10:26.440
Don't think

10:27.320 --> 10:28.080
no one

10:28.510 --> 10:30.440
knows you secretly went to Bamboo House

10:30.440 --> 10:31.270
that night.

10:33.270 --> 10:34.390
Surely you don't think

10:34.390 --> 10:36.240
you can marry Chen Yanyun?

10:39.870 --> 10:41.670
You're thinking too much.

10:44.200 --> 10:45.000
If Chen Yanyun

10:45.670 --> 10:47.130
truly wanted to marry you,

10:48.030 --> 10:48.600
why would he

10:48.600 --> 10:50.120
sneak around to meet you privately?

10:50.120 --> 10:51.510
Why didn't he properly

10:51.510 --> 10:52.750
come to propose?

10:54.120 --> 10:54.960
Obviously,

10:55.150 --> 10:55.870
he just treats you

10:55.870 --> 10:57.320
as a woman outside.

10:59.750 --> 11:00.360
I know

11:01.000 --> 11:02.000
you don't care about

11:02.000 --> 11:03.200
your own reputation.

11:03.390 --> 11:05.320
But the daughters of our Gu Mansion

11:05.630 --> 11:07.360
cannot be someone's mistress.

11:08.600 --> 11:09.960
So the only way now is

11:10.320 --> 11:11.840
for you to obediently marry Wang Zan.

11:11.840 --> 11:13.570
Then everyone will be at peace.

11:27.150 --> 11:29.390
Lian spread rumors about Wang Zan and me.

11:29.390 --> 11:30.750
Your solution is

11:30.870 --> 11:32.070
to marry me off to him.

11:33.840 --> 11:34.900
It seems

11:35.080 --> 11:36.790
you really value Wang Zan.

11:42.360 --> 11:43.430
Marriage

11:43.510 --> 11:44.240
has always been decreed by parents

11:44.240 --> 11:45.510
since ancient times.

11:46.240 --> 11:48.300
I am not discussing this with you now.

11:50.080 --> 11:51.670
I am not discussing this with you either!

11:51.670 --> 11:52.800
I will not marry him.

11:53.150 --> 11:54.630
You'd better just give up on that idea.

11:54.630 --> 11:55.490
That's absurd!

11:56.200 --> 11:56.870
Who allowed you

11:56.870 --> 11:58.390
to speak to an elder like that?

11:58.390 --> 12:01.070
[Gu Mansion]

12:11.790 --> 12:13.320
I heard everything

12:13.390 --> 12:14.790
you said to Second Uncle.

12:15.030 --> 12:16.230
Aren't you afraid that

12:16.230 --> 12:17.600
if you force me like this,

12:17.600 --> 12:18.710
after I marry into the Wang family,

12:18.710 --> 12:19.870
I might spill some things

12:19.870 --> 12:21.200
that shouldn't be said?

12:23.030 --> 12:25.030
That's the family of Chief Justice of
the Imperial Court of Judicial Review!

12:25.030 --> 12:26.150
Do you really think

12:27.000 --> 12:28.530
that no one in the Gu Mansion

12:28.960 --> 12:30.700
can do anything about you?

12:31.320 --> 12:31.870
Someone!

12:32.750 --> 12:33.440
Yes!

12:34.500 --> 12:35.870
Lock her in the wood shed.

12:35.870 --> 12:36.720
Do not let her out

12:36.720 --> 12:37.440
without my orders!

12:37.440 --> 12:37.960
Yes!

12:38.600 --> 12:39.670
Who dares!

13:30.360 --> 13:31.200
Old Madam,

13:31.790 --> 13:33.550
Second Young Master of the Ji family
is here.

13:33.550 --> 13:35.350
with over a dozen carts of gifts,

13:35.550 --> 13:37.630
saying he's here to propose marriage.

13:37.630 --> 13:38.270
He wants

13:38.670 --> 13:40.080
to marry Miss Gu.

13:42.080 --> 13:43.810
It's just a marriage proposal.

13:43.840 --> 13:44.970
What's the big deal?

13:45.670 --> 13:47.360
Just because someone is here to propose,

13:47.360 --> 13:49.420
I can't punish my own granddaughter?

13:49.720 --> 13:50.320
Do it.

13:51.910 --> 13:52.750
Old Madam,

13:53.360 --> 13:56.220
the Ji family is the subordinate
of the Chen family.

14:01.000 --> 14:01.630
Fine.

14:02.840 --> 14:05.240
Have Young Master Ji wait
in the front hall.

14:05.870 --> 14:06.870
I'll go right now.

14:07.120 --> 14:07.630
Yes.

14:10.970 --> 14:12.900
Are my second and fourth sons back?

14:13.240 --> 14:14.360
Only Fourth Master
is off duty

14:14.360 --> 14:15.270
and just back.

14:16.320 --> 14:17.230
Ask him to go too.

14:17.230 --> 14:17.830
Yes.

14:19.750 --> 14:20.870
Go now.

14:29.000 --> 14:30.030
Did you ask Young Master Ji

14:30.030 --> 14:30.960
to come?

14:31.550 --> 14:32.270
No.

14:33.360 --> 14:35.290
Then Chen Yanyun asked him to come?

14:35.440 --> 14:36.390
Of course not.

14:41.960 --> 14:42.600
My Lady.

14:44.320 --> 14:46.380
Second Master came to propose to you!

14:46.390 --> 14:47.750
I don't know what's going on either.

14:47.750 --> 14:48.120
Let's go.

14:48.120 --> 14:50.450
Let's go around to the back
and take a look.

14:50.550 --> 14:52.120
I pay my respects to Old Madam,

14:52.120 --> 14:53.980
Second Madam, and Fourth Master.

14:58.360 --> 14:59.690
Second Young Master Ji.

15:00.550 --> 15:02.150
You want to marry Zhao?

15:02.630 --> 15:03.200
Yes.

15:04.910 --> 15:05.870
This is the betrothal gift list

15:05.870 --> 15:07.390
personally drafted by my grandmother.

15:07.390 --> 15:08.270
Please look it over,

15:08.270 --> 15:09.870
Old Madam and Fourth Master.

15:11.100 --> 15:16.340
[Gu]

15:22.940 --> 15:24.880
[A western glass mirror]
[Two thousand taels of gold]

15:24.790 --> 15:26.120
Two thousand taels of gold.

15:26.120 --> 15:27.920
Fifty thousand taels of silver.

15:31.150 --> 15:32.670
Mother, Mother.

15:41.240 --> 15:42.080
We can talk.

15:42.840 --> 15:43.790
We can talk.

15:45.600 --> 15:47.550
I have also prepared some small gifts

15:47.550 --> 15:48.750
for the elders.

15:48.960 --> 15:50.220
Please do accept them.

15:56.670 --> 15:57.270
Old Madam,

15:58.150 --> 15:59.750
I got this jade bracelet

15:59.750 --> 16:01.510
when I followed the grain boats
to Taungoo.

16:01.510 --> 16:02.790
Wear it in winter for warmth,

16:02.790 --> 16:04.120
in summer for coolness.

16:12.790 --> 16:13.720
Young Master Ji,

16:14.550 --> 16:16.010
you've been too generous.

16:17.030 --> 16:18.000
Coming from so far away,

16:18.000 --> 16:19.260
you must be exhausted.

16:19.910 --> 16:20.600
Someone!

16:22.510 --> 16:23.110
Old Madam.

16:23.510 --> 16:25.540
Help Young Master Ji freshen up.

16:25.670 --> 16:26.360
Afterward,

16:26.550 --> 16:28.480
escort him to the main hall to dine.

16:29.360 --> 16:29.840
Yes.

16:31.550 --> 16:32.750
Thank you, Old Madam.

16:33.750 --> 16:34.680
Young Master Ji,

16:34.870 --> 16:35.870
this way, please.

16:46.150 --> 16:46.720
Well...

16:47.320 --> 16:48.960
You are bold enough to come and propose,

16:48.960 --> 16:50.090
but too shy to see me?

16:52.150 --> 16:53.550
Not everyone is like you,

16:53.550 --> 16:54.810
no sense of shame,

16:54.870 --> 16:56.670
no ability to protect yourself.

16:56.960 --> 16:58.420
You caused such a big stir.

16:58.870 --> 16:59.670
Grandmother hasn't slept well

16:59.670 --> 17:01.070
for days because of that.

17:01.910 --> 17:02.630
So...

17:03.630 --> 17:05.430
Did Grandmother ask you to come?

17:05.480 --> 17:06.030
No.

17:06.920 --> 17:08.720
Grandmother didn't mention it.

17:09.240 --> 17:10.510
I came on my own.

17:12.589 --> 17:13.349
I heard those

17:13.349 --> 17:14.609
nasty words about you.

17:15.500 --> 17:16.730
Those are all rumors.

17:17.069 --> 17:18.550
I know they are rumors.

17:19.069 --> 17:20.530
But gossip is terrifying.

17:21.200 --> 17:22.790
A man can barely withstand it,

17:22.790 --> 17:24.520
let alone a young lady like you.

17:24.829 --> 17:26.240
I just hate seeing people

17:26.240 --> 17:27.920
talk nonsense and slander you.

17:27.920 --> 17:30.160
That doesn't mean you need to
come propose.

17:30.160 --> 17:32.240
Proposing is the best solution.

17:33.310 --> 17:34.030
I inquired.

17:34.550 --> 17:35.310
That Wang Zan

17:35.590 --> 17:37.050
is a notorious scoundrel.

17:37.310 --> 17:38.200
Who knows what trouble

17:38.200 --> 17:39.550
he'll cause later.

17:40.270 --> 17:42.160
Rather than guarding against others
spreading rumors,

17:42.160 --> 17:42.820
it's better

17:42.920 --> 17:44.450
for me to propose to you now.

17:44.920 --> 17:46.880
If anyone dares to trouble you
in the future,

17:46.880 --> 17:48.000
I can rightfully

17:48.000 --> 17:49.530
settle the score with them.

17:50.030 --> 17:50.680
My lady,

17:52.440 --> 17:54.070
the young master arrived in the capital
at noon yesterday.

17:54.070 --> 17:55.960
He was supposed to meet some guests.

17:55.960 --> 17:56.960
But when he heard

17:57.070 --> 17:58.330
that you were bullied,

17:58.350 --> 17:59.440
he was extremely worried.

17:59.440 --> 18:00.590
He canceled his meetings

18:00.590 --> 18:02.510
and immediately returned to Tongzhou
to prepare.

18:02.510 --> 18:03.400
Old Madam said

18:03.440 --> 18:05.310
the weather was bad
and he should wait a few days.

18:05.310 --> 18:06.510
But he couldn't wait,

18:06.640 --> 18:08.500
insisting on rushing here today.

18:08.750 --> 18:10.310
He was afraid you'd be wronged.

18:10.310 --> 18:12.510
He didn't even have time to drink water,

18:12.680 --> 18:14.720
and got blisters all over his mouth
from anxiety.

18:14.720 --> 18:15.400
Stop it.

18:15.960 --> 18:17.160
You are so talkative.

18:18.070 --> 18:19.470
Let's go to my courtyard.

18:19.720 --> 18:21.240
I'll make you some lotus seed soup.

18:21.240 --> 18:22.030
How can I?

18:22.510 --> 18:23.880
Now that I've proposed,

18:24.590 --> 18:26.070
it's already inappropriate for us
to meet like this.

18:26.070 --> 18:27.730
How can I go to your courtyard?

18:29.790 --> 18:31.200
You should go back now.

18:31.590 --> 18:32.510
Don't worry about anything.

18:32.510 --> 18:33.750
Don't meddle in anything.

18:33.750 --> 18:35.160
Leave the rest to me.

18:37.550 --> 18:38.680
You may leave first.

18:39.920 --> 18:40.400
Yes.

18:44.270 --> 18:45.800
How could you be so willful?

18:46.070 --> 18:46.550
This...

18:46.880 --> 18:47.550
Yao.

18:49.160 --> 18:50.160
I am truly touched

18:50.640 --> 18:51.840
by what you're doing.

18:53.640 --> 18:54.590
But do you

18:54.790 --> 18:56.000
really like me?

19:00.350 --> 19:01.030
I...

19:03.160 --> 19:04.550
Of course I like you.

19:05.680 --> 19:06.270
Like a brother

19:06.270 --> 19:07.750
likes a sister?

19:08.400 --> 19:09.830
Or like the "fair lady is a gentleman's
good catch"

19:09.830 --> 19:11.160
kind of liking?

19:17.680 --> 19:19.310
If I am to marry someone,

19:19.570 --> 19:21.000
I will definitely marry a man

19:21.000 --> 19:22.000
who truly loves me

19:22.270 --> 19:23.490
and whom I truly love.

19:24.200 --> 19:25.000
Furthermore,

19:25.200 --> 19:27.070
just a little bit of liking is not enough.

19:27.070 --> 19:28.200
It has to be the kind where

19:28.200 --> 19:29.200
the thought of him

19:29.550 --> 19:31.280
keeps me awake all night,

19:32.070 --> 19:34.470
tossing and turning while thinking of him.

19:34.830 --> 19:36.000
Thinking of him

19:36.510 --> 19:37.580
would make my face burn.

19:37.580 --> 19:39.640
That's the kind of liking it has to be.

19:49.740 --> 19:50.660
Yao.

19:51.440 --> 19:53.510
We grew up together.

19:53.920 --> 19:54.790
I also hope

19:54.910 --> 19:55.920
you can find a woman

19:55.920 --> 19:57.070
you truly yearn for.

19:57.530 --> 19:58.860
You two can get married,

19:59.240 --> 20:01.040
and she can be my sister-in-law.

20:05.510 --> 20:06.790
It's getting late.

20:07.200 --> 20:08.510
Go back and rest early.

20:09.160 --> 20:10.750
I'll have someone make lotus seed soup

20:10.750 --> 20:12.000
and bring it to you.

20:13.960 --> 20:15.020
I'll take my leave.

20:25.030 --> 20:26.640
"Keeps me awake all night."

20:27.640 --> 20:30.170
"Tossing and turning
while thinking of him."

20:30.350 --> 20:32.400
"Making my face burn."

20:35.440 --> 20:36.970
How does she know it so well?

20:53.440 --> 20:54.240
Third Master.

20:54.590 --> 20:56.240
Daxing Granary has a problem.

20:56.240 --> 20:56.750
Look.

21:03.340 --> 21:03.730
[I risk my life to secretly report]

21:03.730 --> 21:04.130
[While loading relief grain
at Daxing Granary the other day...]

21:04.150 --> 21:05.050
[I was shocked to find that the 12 million
kilograms of grain intended for Pingyang]

21:05.080 --> 21:06.010
[had been completely replaced with bran.
Not a single grain of rice was seen]

21:07.720 --> 21:08.720
Bran?

21:11.310 --> 21:13.440
I can't believe they came up with this.

21:13.790 --> 21:15.320
Make a trip there yourself.

21:15.510 --> 21:16.030
No.

21:17.590 --> 21:18.920
Bring the granary manager here.

21:18.920 --> 21:20.580
I want to question him myself.

21:20.920 --> 21:21.400
Yes.

21:29.110 --> 21:30.590
Originally, it was all rice.

21:30.590 --> 21:32.750
Half a month ago, it was changed to bran.

21:32.750 --> 21:33.720
The morning the day before yesterday,
they said

21:33.650 --> 21:38.180
[Immersed in the Classics and History]

21:34.030 --> 21:36.030
it was to be sent to Pingyang
for disaster relief.

21:36.030 --> 21:37.920
I also felt something was wrong.

21:39.110 --> 21:40.680
There is clearly rice in the granary.

21:40.680 --> 21:42.270
Why use bran for disaster relief?

21:42.270 --> 21:43.440
But I saw that their

21:43.510 --> 21:45.030
transport documents were all in order,

21:45.030 --> 21:46.310
so I didn't investigate further.

21:46.310 --> 21:47.510
Who is the Secretary

21:47.550 --> 21:48.960
in charge of this granary?

21:48.960 --> 21:49.510
My Lord,

21:49.680 --> 21:51.110
it's Lord Sun Shitao.

21:51.590 --> 21:52.680
Sun Shitao？

21:53.510 --> 21:54.310
Third Master.

21:54.790 --> 21:55.920
This Sun Shitao

21:55.920 --> 21:57.590
hasn't shown up for days.

21:58.160 --> 21:59.640
Then whose orders have you been following

21:59.640 --> 22:02.100
for the grain movements
these past two days?

22:03.200 --> 22:04.350
My Lord, look.

22:12.680 --> 22:14.790
[Gu Dezhao]

22:23.110 --> 22:25.460
[Immersed in the Classics and History]

22:48.790 --> 22:50.250
Greetings, Third Master.

22:50.960 --> 22:51.620
Have a seat.

22:52.830 --> 22:54.230
Has something happened?

22:54.960 --> 22:56.360
Why did you have Mr. Jiang

22:56.510 --> 22:58.110
bring me here secretly?

22:58.400 --> 22:59.190
No rush.

23:00.030 --> 23:01.760
Sit down and we can talk slowly.

23:05.830 --> 23:07.960
No one in your family noticed, right?

23:09.200 --> 23:10.570
I had Qingpu keep watch.

23:10.830 --> 23:12.000
No one will notice.

23:17.070 --> 23:17.800
Here you are.

23:19.160 --> 23:20.160
Have some tea

23:20.510 --> 23:21.640
to calm your nerves.

23:22.270 --> 23:24.000
Has something major happened?

23:24.270 --> 23:25.030
Otherwise,

23:25.310 --> 23:27.200
you wouldn't have asked me to come.

23:27.200 --> 23:28.660
No matter how urgent it is,

23:28.720 --> 23:29.680
we shouldn't talk about business

23:29.680 --> 23:30.740
the moment we meet.

23:31.240 --> 23:32.110
What would be

23:32.720 --> 23:35.580
the difference from being at
the Wenyuan Pavilion?

23:37.920 --> 23:38.680
I heard

23:38.960 --> 23:40.240
Ji Yao proposed to you.

23:40.880 --> 23:41.750
I didn't agree.

23:49.270 --> 23:49.990
Oh right,

23:53.400 --> 23:55.510
after you gave it to me last time,

23:56.510 --> 23:58.000
I thought it was pretty good.

23:58.000 --> 23:59.260
I specially found some

23:59.960 --> 24:00.830
for you to try.

24:09.830 --> 24:10.360
How is it?

24:10.440 --> 24:11.700
Does it taste the same?

24:12.720 --> 24:13.650
It's delicious.

24:16.090 --> 24:18.150
Alright, let's get down to business.

24:19.080 --> 24:20.350
There's a severe drought in Pingyang.

24:20.350 --> 24:22.550
The Ministry of Revenue has authorized

24:22.830 --> 24:25.030
12 million kilograms of relief grains.

24:25.070 --> 24:26.590
But someone sabotaged

24:27.070 --> 24:28.870
and replaced the rice with bran.

24:32.590 --> 24:34.110
I am in charge of the Ministry of Revenue.

24:34.110 --> 24:34.960
And this happened

24:34.960 --> 24:36.700
right under my nose.

24:37.030 --> 24:37.920
Obviously,

24:38.510 --> 24:40.640
they want me to take the blame for this.

24:40.720 --> 24:42.590
But they are afraid I won't be willing.

24:42.590 --> 24:43.830
So I am being watched.

24:44.310 --> 24:45.110
So,

24:45.550 --> 24:47.310
apologies for the unorthodox meeting

24:47.310 --> 24:48.270
this time.

24:50.720 --> 24:51.880
My father

24:52.400 --> 24:54.750
is a Director of the Treasury
in the Ministry of Revenue,

24:54.750 --> 24:56.610
He is in charge of Daxing Granary.

24:56.720 --> 24:57.440
Could it be

24:57.720 --> 24:58.350
him?

24:58.680 --> 25:00.140
He is also kept in the dark.

25:01.110 --> 25:02.680
Someone forged his seal.

25:03.680 --> 25:04.200
Who?

25:04.830 --> 25:06.290
Your father's colleague,

25:06.550 --> 25:07.400
Sun Shitao.

25:08.200 --> 25:09.400
This person is Wang Xuanfan's

25:09.400 --> 25:10.920
old subordinate planted
in the Ministry of Revenue.

25:10.920 --> 25:12.200
He's disappeared now,

25:12.500 --> 25:14.500
but I've sent people to look for him.

25:15.790 --> 25:16.830
Wang Xuanfan.

25:18.000 --> 25:19.230
Why did he do this?

25:19.550 --> 25:20.880
To bring down Fan Chuan.

25:21.750 --> 25:23.440
Zhao Jichang, the Provincial Administration
Commissioner of Shanxi,

25:23.440 --> 25:25.240
is Fan Chuan's brother-in-law.

25:25.240 --> 25:25.920
This person

25:26.270 --> 25:27.470
is insatiably greedy

25:27.880 --> 25:29.880
and colludes with grain merchants.

25:30.030 --> 25:31.510
But because of Fan Chuan,

25:32.110 --> 25:33.400
no one dares take action against him.

25:33.400 --> 25:34.070
However,

25:34.270 --> 25:35.960
the relief fraud is a major case,

25:35.960 --> 25:38.000
so he has to cooperate
with the investigation.

25:38.000 --> 25:39.440
And Zhao Jichang's sister,

25:39.440 --> 25:40.950
Fan Chuan's wife,

25:41.270 --> 25:42.790
usually acts flamboyantly

25:42.790 --> 25:44.550
and has left many vulnerabilities.

25:44.550 --> 25:46.480
Once Zhao Jichang is brought down,

25:46.790 --> 25:47.680
Madam Fan

25:48.270 --> 25:49.800
will certainly not escape.

25:50.110 --> 25:50.830
By then,

25:51.020 --> 25:53.950
no matter how Fan Chuan tries to
prove his innocence,

25:54.270 --> 25:56.200
things will be exposed one by one.

25:56.440 --> 25:57.160
In the end,

25:58.240 --> 26:01.240
he'll have no choice but to resign
as Senior Minister.

26:01.390 --> 26:02.790
He will end up miserably.

26:03.510 --> 26:04.240
Since

26:04.790 --> 26:06.320
Wang Xuanfan made the move,

26:07.510 --> 26:09.440
doesn't that mean the mastermind behind this

26:09.440 --> 26:10.440
is Fu...?

26:11.680 --> 26:12.510
I'm not sure.

26:13.110 --> 26:14.170
He might know,

26:14.640 --> 26:15.440
or he might

26:16.030 --> 26:17.160
pretend not to know.

26:18.400 --> 26:19.240
No wonder

26:19.960 --> 26:22.160
you already knew you were being tailed,

26:22.440 --> 26:23.720
but couldn't make a move

26:23.720 --> 26:24.850
and had to hide here.

26:26.160 --> 26:27.830
Using bran as disaster relief grain,

26:27.830 --> 26:28.590
by law,

26:28.640 --> 26:30.200
shouldn't that be a capital offense?

26:30.200 --> 26:31.860
If it causes a civil uprising,

26:32.200 --> 26:33.010
then

26:33.310 --> 26:36.510
even the execution of nine relations
wouldn't be enough.

26:37.400 --> 26:38.830
The relief grain

26:38.830 --> 26:40.430
was just sent out yesterday.

26:40.550 --> 26:42.010
Can it still be retrieved?

26:46.070 --> 26:46.800
Most likely,

26:47.590 --> 26:48.590
it can't be.

26:50.000 --> 26:51.680
They set up such a big trap.

26:52.110 --> 26:53.590
So they won't act

26:53.680 --> 26:55.140
until the case breaks out.

26:56.440 --> 26:57.470
What should we do?

26:58.050 --> 26:59.480
You don't need to worry too much.

26:59.480 --> 27:01.750
I've already figured out a countermeasure.

27:01.750 --> 27:03.880
It will take about seven days

27:04.750 --> 27:06.270
from the capital to Pingyang.

27:06.270 --> 27:07.510
For news

27:07.680 --> 27:09.590
to travel from Shanxi to the capital,

27:09.590 --> 27:11.120
an eight-hundred-li relay

27:11.240 --> 27:12.270
takes at most

27:12.270 --> 27:13.240
four days.

27:13.640 --> 27:15.400
The grain was just shipped out yesterday.

27:15.400 --> 27:16.310
That is to say,

27:16.920 --> 27:18.400
we still have nine days.

27:19.350 --> 27:20.510
If I'm not mistaken,

27:21.110 --> 27:22.160
Sun Shitao

27:22.160 --> 27:23.750
is likely dead or in grave danger by now.

27:23.750 --> 27:24.960
But dead or alive,

27:25.880 --> 27:26.960
as long as we find him,

27:26.960 --> 27:28.680
this matter won't be that simple.

27:28.680 --> 27:29.400
So

27:29.400 --> 27:30.790
you'll have a reason
to go to Shuntian Prefecture

27:30.790 --> 27:31.750
to seek justice.

27:32.590 --> 27:33.550
So next,

27:33.550 --> 27:34.550
what you need to do

27:34.750 --> 27:36.280
is try everything possible

27:36.750 --> 27:37.970
to delay this case.

27:38.550 --> 27:39.810
The longer it drags on,

27:40.310 --> 27:42.370
the more room we'll have to maneuver.

27:44.030 --> 27:44.880
I understand.

27:45.960 --> 27:46.720
But

27:46.960 --> 27:48.890
you're the Grand Secretary's man.

27:48.920 --> 27:50.380
By telling me this,

27:50.590 --> 27:52.790
aren't you putting yourself in danger?

27:53.640 --> 27:54.650
In this trap,

27:55.050 --> 27:56.240
I'm the pawn.

27:57.400 --> 27:58.810
Once the case breaks out,

27:58.920 --> 28:00.980
I'll inevitably face imprisonment.

28:02.000 --> 28:02.920
So you're doing this

28:02.920 --> 28:04.350
to save yourself as much as

28:04.350 --> 28:05.400
to save me.

28:07.550 --> 28:08.550
When that time comes,

28:08.550 --> 28:09.650
I'm behind bars,

28:11.110 --> 28:12.840
and I'll be all counting on you.

28:22.110 --> 28:23.640
Before I left Pingyang,

28:23.790 --> 28:24.550
there was only

28:24.550 --> 28:26.210
one day of very light drizzle.

28:26.350 --> 28:27.810
It was a drop in the bucket.

28:27.920 --> 28:28.510
I heard

28:28.590 --> 28:30.750
the Provincial Administration Commission
has requested aid from the capital.

28:30.750 --> 28:31.310
In a few days,

28:31.310 --> 28:32.770
relief grain will arrive.

28:33.160 --> 28:33.830
I suppose

28:34.510 --> 28:35.770
things should be fine.

28:37.920 --> 28:40.070
The disaster victims must receive relief.

28:40.070 --> 28:41.830
That is the foundation of everything.

28:41.830 --> 28:43.630
Once there is a riot in Pingyang,

28:43.960 --> 28:44.750
both of us,

28:45.720 --> 28:47.750
no matter how we cry out our grievances
at the official gate,

28:47.750 --> 28:49.680
or claim to be grievously wronged,

28:50.830 --> 28:52.920
it won't help. We'll be doomed.

28:55.270 --> 28:57.000
How many grain do we have stored

28:57.030 --> 28:58.230
in Pingyang, Shanxi?

28:58.680 --> 29:00.540
After you ordered me to buy grain,

29:00.590 --> 29:02.480
I immediately bought two batches,

29:02.480 --> 29:04.200
totaling around 210,000 kilograms.

29:04.200 --> 29:06.310
Later, seeing the drought worsening,

29:06.310 --> 29:07.310
I spent more money

29:07.510 --> 29:09.510
and gathered over 60,000 kilograms
from nearby areas.

29:09.510 --> 29:10.400
Altogether,

29:10.620 --> 29:12.350
it's about 300,000 kilograms.

29:15.730 --> 29:16.990
300,000 kilograms...

29:18.440 --> 29:20.440
300,000 kilograms is still not enough.

29:20.440 --> 29:22.160
You must go to Shaanxi, Henan,

29:23.030 --> 29:23.830
and Jiangnan.

29:25.440 --> 29:27.040
Even if it costs extra money,

29:27.070 --> 29:27.930
you must buy it.

29:28.110 --> 29:29.310
Buy as much as you can.

29:30.510 --> 29:32.110
If there is a problem with
the relief grain,

29:32.110 --> 29:33.070
we will find a way

29:33.200 --> 29:35.330
help the authorities provide relief.

29:37.350 --> 29:38.960
Also get the porridge kitchens
and medicine

29:38.960 --> 29:40.030
all prepared.

29:41.820 --> 29:42.510
My lady,

29:42.590 --> 29:43.520
what's going on?

29:43.830 --> 29:44.920
How did you know

29:45.030 --> 29:46.830
the relief grain would be problematic?

29:46.830 --> 29:47.690
Don't ask that.

29:48.240 --> 29:49.370
You only need to know

29:49.510 --> 29:51.440
that this matter is extremely important.

29:51.440 --> 29:52.030
We must try our best

29:52.030 --> 29:53.110
to prevent disaster victims in Pingyang

29:53.110 --> 29:54.310
from starting a riot.

29:55.510 --> 29:56.440
Here is the plan.

29:56.830 --> 29:59.030
You take fifty thousand taels of silver

29:59.030 --> 30:00.830
and make another trip to Shanxi.

30:01.510 --> 30:01.960
Yes.

30:09.380 --> 30:15.350
[Wenyuan Pavilion]

30:12.640 --> 30:14.310
Third Mr. Chen, let me ask you.

30:14.640 --> 30:15.920
Where is the grain?

30:16.110 --> 30:17.210
Where is it?

30:17.790 --> 30:18.480
Lord Fan.

30:18.480 --> 30:19.350
Lord Fan.

30:19.550 --> 30:20.310
Lord Fan.

30:20.640 --> 30:22.040
What's the need for this?

30:22.590 --> 30:24.270
The Grand Secretary is not here today.

30:24.270 --> 30:25.070
Please just calm down.

30:25.070 --> 30:26.460
Please calm down.

30:26.790 --> 30:29.110
Lord Fan, you talk as if...

30:29.310 --> 30:30.570
How could Jiuheng know

30:30.680 --> 30:32.280
about a matter this serious?

30:33.000 --> 30:35.070
He's in charge of
the Ministry of Revenue!

30:35.070 --> 30:36.000
If he knew,

30:36.000 --> 30:37.400
what would that make him?

30:37.440 --> 30:39.350
Surely he can't claim

30:39.350 --> 30:40.240
he ordered the relief grain to be

30:40.240 --> 30:41.770
replaced with bran, can he?

30:42.240 --> 30:43.960
Whether he ordered it or not

30:43.960 --> 30:46.490
will be easily known
through investigation.

30:47.550 --> 30:48.410
Third Mr. Chen,

30:49.030 --> 30:51.230
you cannot escape involvement in this.

30:51.550 --> 30:53.160
If a civil uprising occurs,

30:53.680 --> 30:56.680
ten thousand deaths wouldn't be enough
to pardon you.

30:56.790 --> 30:58.790
Lord Fan, you are absolutely right.

30:59.110 --> 31:00.970
This case is of great importance.

31:01.110 --> 31:03.200
It must be tried
by the Three Judiciary Offices.

31:03.200 --> 31:03.930
At that time,

31:04.400 --> 31:06.130
I will have to be interrogated.

31:11.350 --> 31:12.750
Here is my resignation.

31:13.070 --> 31:13.790
Please,

31:13.790 --> 31:14.440
Lord He,

31:15.440 --> 31:17.500
hand it to the Grand Secretary for me.

31:18.160 --> 31:18.920
Jiuheng...

31:23.070 --> 31:23.720
All right.

31:23.380 --> 31:24.780
[Chen Jiuheng,
Left Vice Minister of Revenue

31:24.780 --> 31:26.190
and Grand Secretary of Eastern Cabinet,
respectfully submits]

31:24.920 --> 31:25.440
You...

31:26.830 --> 31:28.750
You prepared this in advance!

31:28.750 --> 31:31.010
And you still claim you had no knowledge!

31:32.110 --> 31:34.320
Here is a newly drafted memorial.

31:34.720 --> 31:35.920
Please, Lord He,

31:36.240 --> 31:38.500
hand it to the Grand Secretary for me too.

31:42.000 --> 31:42.400
You...

31:42.720 --> 31:44.440
You want to impeach Lord Fan?

31:45.550 --> 31:46.370
What?

31:47.350 --> 31:49.600
What are you impeaching me for?

31:50.110 --> 31:51.830
I am impeaching Lord Fan

31:52.550 --> 31:54.070
for unduly promoting his brother-in-law
Zhao Jichang,

31:54.070 --> 31:56.400
Shanxi Provincial Administration
Commissioner,

31:56.400 --> 31:57.900
facilitating

31:58.070 --> 31:59.730
his illegal activities, etc.

31:59.830 --> 32:01.070
Ten charges in total.

32:03.830 --> 32:05.700
How dare you!

32:06.070 --> 32:07.400
You orchestrated this trap,

32:07.400 --> 32:08.060
didn't you?

32:08.640 --> 32:10.300
First, you ruin Zhao Jichang,

32:10.440 --> 32:11.890
then you impeach me,

32:12.000 --> 32:14.790
planning to make me resign in disgrace

32:14.790 --> 32:16.030
and leave the Grand Secretariat,

32:16.030 --> 32:17.150
isn't that right?

32:18.240 --> 32:20.290
Does Fu Hailian know about this?

32:21.200 --> 32:22.750
He knows, right?

32:23.240 --> 32:25.510
That's why he deliberately
claimed illness today,

32:25.510 --> 32:26.510
isn't that right?

32:29.790 --> 32:30.510
I will

32:31.000 --> 32:32.130
take my leave first.

32:33.880 --> 32:34.310
You...

33:09.270 --> 33:11.070
Lord Zhang, are you going to handle
official business?

33:11.070 --> 33:12.510
There's a severe drought in Pingyang.

33:12.510 --> 33:14.440
The Court's 12 million kilograms of
relief grain

33:14.440 --> 33:16.030
ended up being bran.

33:17.920 --> 33:18.720
Commander Ye.

33:19.310 --> 33:20.310
I remember your older sister

33:20.310 --> 33:21.000
married into

33:21.000 --> 33:22.660
the Gu family of Daxin, right?

33:23.110 --> 33:23.880
Perhaps you could

33:23.880 --> 33:25.680
take a trip there yourself,

33:26.350 --> 33:27.640
since you know the way.

33:31.790 --> 33:32.510
No problem.

33:36.030 --> 33:36.590
Not only

33:36.590 --> 33:38.850
Gu Dezhao, the Director of the Treasury,

33:39.160 --> 33:40.830
but also every other male in Gu Mansion,

33:40.830 --> 33:41.590
not one missed,

33:41.590 --> 33:42.990
must all be brought back.

33:43.720 --> 33:46.720
You're using public office
to settle private scores.

33:47.510 --> 33:49.460
By order of the Grand Secretary.

33:49.510 --> 33:51.370
Go ask him if you don't believe me.

34:00.440 --> 34:05.180
[Eternal Glory]

34:31.960 --> 34:32.710
Zhao!

34:33.960 --> 34:34.670
Zhao!

34:37.110 --> 34:38.320
Ye Xian brought the constables
from the Penal Court

34:38.320 --> 34:39.000
to make arrests.

34:39.000 --> 34:40.230
They even want to arrest Rong.

34:40.230 --> 34:40.760
Hurry up!

34:40.880 --> 34:42.880
Let's go check the front courtyard!

35:00.750 --> 35:02.960
I really don't know what's going on.

35:02.960 --> 35:05.030
I am truly wronged!

35:05.510 --> 35:06.370
Your Highness,

35:06.710 --> 35:08.600
please tell your superiors.

35:08.920 --> 35:12.150
What does this have to do
with our Censorate?

35:12.150 --> 35:13.150
Why am I

35:13.150 --> 35:14.920
being implicated in the crime too?

35:14.920 --> 35:16.150
And involving all the men

35:16.150 --> 35:18.440
in our Gu family?

35:19.590 --> 35:20.450
Take them away!

35:20.960 --> 35:21.360
Move.

35:21.360 --> 35:22.220
Your Highness!

35:22.400 --> 35:23.710
-Your Highness.
-Your Highness.

35:23.710 --> 35:24.110
Move!

35:24.110 --> 35:25.150
You can't do this!

35:25.170 --> 35:26.840
-We're wronged!
-Your Highness!

35:26.840 --> 35:28.320
-Uncle!
-Your Highness.

35:28.670 --> 35:30.470
Uncle, why are you arresting me?

35:30.590 --> 35:31.110
-What exactly...
-Zhao!

35:31.110 --> 35:32.190
What exactly happened?

35:32.190 --> 35:32.960
Zhao!

35:33.280 --> 35:34.780
Save me quickly, Zhao!

35:34.840 --> 35:35.770
Cousin Jinzhao!

35:42.710 --> 35:44.510
The decree says detention pending trial,

35:44.510 --> 35:46.630
meaning the case hasn't been
resolved yet.

35:46.630 --> 35:48.440
You have a clear conscience
regarding this matter.

35:48.440 --> 35:49.050
Once you're in prison,

35:49.050 --> 35:50.470
eat well, sleep well,

35:50.670 --> 35:52.330
don't take anything to heart,

35:52.510 --> 35:54.110
and take care of yourselves.

35:56.000 --> 35:56.730
Come closer.

36:10.840 --> 36:11.510
Step aside.

36:15.110 --> 36:16.040
What's going on?

36:16.400 --> 36:17.530
Even Xian and Rong

36:17.560 --> 36:19.490
are going to be arrested this time.

36:21.840 --> 36:23.670
The decree only ordered
the arrest of your father.

36:23.670 --> 36:26.800
That bastard Zhang Ling is acting
out of personal spite.

36:27.510 --> 36:28.280
I see.

36:30.030 --> 36:32.070
I've already made arrangements
inside the prison.

36:32.070 --> 36:32.870
Rest assured.

36:33.880 --> 36:35.150
You too.

36:35.360 --> 36:36.290
Be very careful.

36:39.710 --> 36:41.290
Has the people been brought here?

36:41.290 --> 36:42.950
Everyone is here, Commander.

36:43.360 --> 36:43.960
Xian.

36:44.590 --> 36:45.280
Mother!

36:45.670 --> 36:46.280
Mother!

36:46.550 --> 36:46.920
Xian!

36:46.920 --> 36:47.590
Mother, save me!

36:47.590 --> 36:48.000
Move!

36:48.400 --> 36:48.760
Yes.

36:50.440 --> 36:50.900
Mother!

36:50.920 --> 36:51.280
Xian!

36:51.280 --> 36:51.740
Mother!

36:52.320 --> 36:53.400
Ye Xian! Ye Xian!

36:53.400 --> 36:53.960
Mother!

36:54.000 --> 36:54.800
Release Xian.

36:54.800 --> 36:56.190
He's your nephew!

36:57.590 --> 36:58.110
Ye Xian!

36:58.840 --> 36:59.550
Ye Xian!

37:00.110 --> 37:01.370
-Fifth Auntie.
-Ye...

37:03.110 --> 37:04.960
His Highness is only acting on orders.

37:04.960 --> 37:06.670
There are so many eyes watching.

37:06.670 --> 37:07.590
Don't worry.

37:07.590 --> 37:08.840
As long as His Highness is here,

37:08.840 --> 37:10.340
Xian won't suffer.

37:11.400 --> 37:12.200
You are right.

37:14.320 --> 37:14.960
Zhao.

37:16.280 --> 37:17.660
It was my fault

37:17.800 --> 37:19.090
to force you before.

37:19.230 --> 37:20.930
You are close with Lord Chen.

37:21.070 --> 37:22.030
Please beg him

37:22.230 --> 37:23.430
to save us.

37:23.800 --> 37:24.600
Grandmother.

37:25.000 --> 37:27.190
It's not that I don't want to
beg Third Master.

37:27.190 --> 37:28.440
It's just that

37:28.920 --> 37:31.030
he probably can't intervene this time.

37:31.030 --> 37:32.360
There's a problem
with the disaster relief grain.

37:32.360 --> 37:33.510
He is in charge of
the Ministry of Revenue.

37:33.510 --> 37:36.000
He'll have to be questioned
by the Three Judiciary Offices himself.

37:36.000 --> 37:37.860
He will likely be imprisoned too.

37:39.390 --> 37:41.110
-Then what should we do?
-Mother.

37:41.110 --> 37:42.380
Then what should we do?

37:42.670 --> 37:43.860
All the men in our household

37:43.860 --> 37:44.990
have been arrested.

37:45.230 --> 37:46.230
What should we do?

37:46.550 --> 37:47.840
What should we do?

37:49.030 --> 37:50.030
What should we do?

37:50.840 --> 37:51.640
Grandmother.

37:52.150 --> 37:53.880
It's not completely hopeless.

37:56.220 --> 37:57.440
Master's private seal,

37:57.440 --> 37:58.570
letters,

37:58.760 --> 37:59.510
and account books...

37:59.510 --> 38:00.510
Find them all.

38:01.000 --> 38:01.590
Don't miss anything.

38:01.590 --> 38:02.380
Be careful.

38:02.440 --> 38:02.960
Yes.

38:06.030 --> 38:07.960
My Lady, please take a look at this.

38:14.800 --> 38:15.510
Lord Chen.

38:16.400 --> 38:17.230
Let me ask you.

38:17.960 --> 38:21.030
Do you know why the 12 million kilograms
of disaster relief grain

38:21.030 --> 38:22.880
turned into bran?

38:23.920 --> 38:25.360
I don't know.

38:26.280 --> 38:28.480
Grain entering and leaving the granary

38:28.510 --> 38:31.150
requires careful approval from
the Ministry of Revenue at every step.

38:31.150 --> 38:32.670
[Wang Shenzhi, Chief Justice of the Imperial
Court of Judicial Review]

38:31.320 --> 38:32.920
As Vice Minister of Revenue,

38:33.000 --> 38:34.510
you are in charge of the Revenue.

38:34.510 --> 38:35.770
How could you not know?

38:36.500 --> 38:38.300
It was my momentary negligence.

38:38.670 --> 38:40.630
I didn't know the grain was replaced.

38:40.630 --> 38:41.960
Momentary negligence?

38:46.510 --> 38:47.640
These two documents

38:47.840 --> 38:49.350
were both approved by you

38:49.590 --> 38:51.800
half a month ago.

38:52.400 --> 38:54.760
One of them, the grain replacement order,

38:55.070 --> 38:57.070
cites the reason that
the old grain stockpile,

38:56.860 --> 38:58.420
[Censor Song Huai, Imperial Commissioner
for Relief Supervision]

38:57.150 --> 38:58.440
if kept too long,

38:58.450 --> 38:59.130
[By imperial decree, funds from
the horse procurement treasury are hereby

38:58.710 --> 39:00.780
might spoil, harming both state granaries
and people's needs,

38:59.130 --> 38:59.820
allocated for the purchase of medicines.
Respect this imperial command]

39:00.960 --> 39:02.420
so it requested new grain.

39:03.000 --> 39:05.720
And the replacement order
and the grain allocation order

39:05.090 --> 39:07.510
[Chen Yanyun, Left Vice Minister
of Revenue, approved]

39:05.800 --> 39:07.360
were only three days apart.

39:07.840 --> 39:08.510
How do you

39:09.150 --> 39:10.510
explain this?

39:17.210 --> 39:21.350
[Gu Dezhao, Director of the Treasury
of the Ministry of Revenue]

39:22.760 --> 39:23.450
Zhao.

39:23.510 --> 39:24.190
This letter

39:24.190 --> 39:25.360
mentions this Sun Shitao,

39:25.360 --> 39:26.440
in the 35th year of Jingning,

39:26.440 --> 39:27.440
sought a transfer

39:27.510 --> 39:28.550
but was stopped by Master.

39:28.550 --> 39:29.230
So he poured tea

39:29.230 --> 39:32.090
on the memorial Master had just
finished drafting.

39:33.270 --> 39:34.640
[I serve as a junior clerk
assisting in this case]

39:34.660 --> 39:37.300
[Lest you be unaware of the hidden facts,
I humbly submit the truth of the matter]

39:36.920 --> 39:38.630
It seems there's an old grudge.

39:38.630 --> 39:39.360
This is useful.

39:39.360 --> 39:39.940
Keep it.

39:40.880 --> 39:41.320
Okay.

39:42.150 --> 39:42.880
Lord Chen.

39:43.400 --> 39:45.060
Who in the Ministry of Revenue

39:45.190 --> 39:47.710
do you think has such great ability

39:48.320 --> 39:50.970
to settle so many people and matters

39:51.190 --> 39:53.670
without being discovered?

40:05.110 --> 40:05.840
Lord Chen,

40:06.360 --> 40:07.510
why are you silent?

40:08.850 --> 40:09.650
I

40:11.670 --> 40:12.800
have nothing to say.

40:13.520 --> 40:14.380
Lord Chen,

40:15.030 --> 40:17.360
although you are an important minister
of the Imperial Court,

40:17.360 --> 40:20.430
this case is too important.

40:20.510 --> 40:22.710
Now you say that you have nothing to say.

40:22.800 --> 40:23.630
Then

40:23.920 --> 40:24.840
I have no choice

40:24.840 --> 40:26.570
but to ask you to spend some time

40:26.800 --> 40:28.260
in the Penal Court prison.

40:37.360 --> 40:38.230
Lord Yao,

40:39.000 --> 40:41.440
just act according to the rules.

41:17.000 --> 41:17.960
How is it?

41:18.030 --> 41:18.960
Did you find out?

41:19.400 --> 41:20.530
How is Third Master?

41:21.440 --> 41:23.710
He's been locked up
in the Penal Court prison.

41:23.710 --> 41:25.710
They said he admitted to negligence.

41:25.710 --> 41:26.840
The Three Judiciary Offices
held a joint trial,

41:26.840 --> 41:28.240
and it was over in an hour.

41:31.190 --> 41:33.590
In this trap, I'm the pawn.

41:34.030 --> 41:35.430
Once the case breaks out,

41:35.710 --> 41:37.770
I'll inevitably face imprisonment.

41:38.510 --> 41:39.000
Zhao.

41:40.920 --> 41:41.510
Zhao.

41:42.440 --> 41:43.320
I'm fine.

41:45.230 --> 41:46.320
So he took full responsibility

41:46.320 --> 41:47.400
upon himself.

41:48.150 --> 41:48.710
Yes.

41:49.440 --> 41:50.030
Also,

41:51.070 --> 41:52.800
I found a clue about Sun Shitao.

41:53.880 --> 41:55.120
I never expected.

41:55.230 --> 41:55.670
Jiuheng

41:55.460 --> 42:02.240
[A sage ruler attracts good ministers]

41:55.670 --> 41:57.400
didn't utter a word of defense.

41:57.670 --> 41:59.090
He just said it was his own negligence

41:59.090 --> 42:00.900
and took all the blame.

42:02.880 --> 42:04.360
He didn't defend himself,

42:04.760 --> 42:06.420
not because he didn't want to,

42:06.510 --> 42:07.360
but because

42:07.960 --> 42:09.760
he saw right through your plan

42:10.630 --> 42:12.490
and just didn't want to expose it.

42:12.650 --> 42:14.320
He saw that this plan

42:14.370 --> 42:16.370
had your tacit approval, didn't he?

42:19.400 --> 42:19.920
Yes,

42:20.630 --> 42:22.020
Jiuheng is smart,

42:22.360 --> 42:24.440
but I also gave myself away on purpose,

42:24.440 --> 42:26.170
so he could play along.

42:28.510 --> 42:30.110
You think I don't know?

42:30.110 --> 42:31.310
You deliberately

42:31.670 --> 42:33.000
kept him in the dark.

42:34.110 --> 42:35.090
Prime Minister,

42:35.440 --> 42:36.840
I had no choice.

42:37.110 --> 42:38.230
With a matter this big,

42:38.230 --> 42:41.090
the fewer people know at the beginning,
the better.

42:41.400 --> 42:42.150
Besides,

42:42.760 --> 42:43.840
Jiuheng

42:43.840 --> 42:45.150
may seem gentle on the outside,

42:45.150 --> 42:47.280
but he's extremely proud in his bones.

42:48.070 --> 42:49.600
I was afraid he would refuse

42:49.670 --> 42:50.870
and ruin everything.

42:51.190 --> 42:52.110
All right.

42:52.110 --> 42:53.440
Let's not talk about this anymore.

42:53.440 --> 42:55.150
When he gets out of prison,

42:55.220 --> 42:56.840
I'll mediate

42:56.860 --> 42:58.020
between you two.

43:00.030 --> 43:01.300
How is Fan Chuan?

43:02.360 --> 43:03.030
He's sick.

43:03.630 --> 43:05.760
He collapsed the day he returned home.

43:05.880 --> 43:06.920
Last night, when he heard Zhao Jichang

43:06.920 --> 43:08.730
was found guilty of corruption, fraud,

43:08.730 --> 43:10.480
reselling granary supplies,
and other crimes,

43:10.480 --> 43:12.710
and ordered to be arrested
and escorted to the capital,

43:12.710 --> 43:14.300
he collapsed immediately.

43:15.000 --> 43:15.800
I was thinking

43:15.800 --> 43:17.480
we can have those imperial censors,

43:17.480 --> 43:18.510
such as Han Song, Wang Chuyi,

43:18.510 --> 43:19.770
start impeaching him.

43:20.030 --> 43:20.760
Strike

43:22.400 --> 43:23.520
while the iron is hot.

43:23.520 --> 43:28.500
[A sage ruler attracts good ministers]

43:27.840 --> 43:28.770
Prime Minister,

43:28.840 --> 43:29.730
The Governor of Shuntian Prefecture

43:29.730 --> 43:31.460
just sent a message,

43:31.760 --> 43:32.310
saying that

43:32.310 --> 43:33.920
the daughter of Director Gu
of the Ministry of Revenue

43:33.920 --> 43:35.150
has filed a petition

43:35.280 --> 43:36.800
at the Shuntian Prefecture's
government office.

43:36.800 --> 43:37.930
She said Director Gu

43:38.920 --> 43:40.870
was framed.

43:41.030 --> 43:43.290
She wants to seek justice for her father.

43:43.550 --> 43:44.970
Which Director Gu?

43:45.510 --> 43:46.880
The Director of the Treasury,

43:46.880 --> 43:47.730
Gu Dezhao.

43:48.360 --> 43:50.230
The one who signed off
on the grain release.

43:50.230 --> 43:51.880
His daughter?

43:54.230 --> 43:55.150
The one

43:56.550 --> 43:58.150
who competed

43:58.150 --> 44:01.280
with Jiuheng in horseback archery
at the Spring Outing?

44:01.360 --> 44:02.100
I think so.

44:15.790 --> 44:19.270
[A Splendid Match]
